        <figure><a href="evidence/daily-scrum-2026-08-21.png" target="_blank"><img src="evidence/daily-scrum-2026-08-21.png" alt="Microsoft Teams record of the Daily Scrum progress checkpoint on 21 August 2026" /></a><figcaption><strong>21 Aug · Daily Scrum checkpoint</strong><p>The team discussed active blockers and what information/evidence should be included in the documentation website. The Teams record shows a meeting duration of approximately 26 minutes.</p><span>Project methodology · Blockers · Documentation</span></figcaption></figure>
