      <section id="sprint1-coverage-evidence"><h2>Sprint 1 coverage evidence · 25 August 2026</h2><p>The first dated Codecov snapshot is retained as part of Sprint 1 evidence. The GitHub deployment mirror CI rerun passed its backend, frontend and PostgreSQL smoke jobs, and Codecov received separate frontend/backend coverage reports.</p><div className="metric-grid"><article><strong>81.58%</strong><span>Frontend</span><small>Codecov · frontend/src</small></article><article><strong>86.37%</strong><span>Backend</span><small>Codecov · src</small></article><article><strong>25 Aug</strong><span>Snapshot date</span><small>Sprint 1 review evidence</small></article></div><div className="coverage-gallery compact"><figure><a href="evidence/codecov-overview-sprint1-2026-08-25.png" target="_blank"><img src="evidence/codecov-overview-sprint1-2026-08-25.png" alt="Tutor MX Sprint 1 Codecov overview dated 25 August 2026" /></a><figcaption><strong>Codecov overview · 25 Aug 2026</strong><p>This snapshot is not overwritten when later sprint evidence is added. Sprint 2, 3 and 4 should each receive their own dated coverage record.</p><span>Testing · Code quality · Sprint 1</span></figcaption></figure></div><p><a href="#testing">Open Testing for the full CI and Codecov screenshot set →</a></p></section>
